title: Welcome aboard
files:
  - .assets/img-100-01-01.png
  - .assets/img-100-01-02.png

steps:

  - text: |

      {[ht,$start]Welcome aboard}

      This initial tour has two primary objectives:

      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]} Learning how to use the **EM&bull;TOUR GUIDE**.

      {[bi,arrow_circle_right]} Tweaking the UI to remove some visual clutter.

      To proceed through the current tour, you'll use the five buttons across the top of this view:

      {[bm,1]} **Back** &ndash; go to the previous stop on this tour<br>
      {[bm,2]} **Next** &ndash; go to the next stop on this tour<br>
      {[bm,3]} **Refresh** &ndash; replay the current stop on this tour<br>
      {[bm,4]} **Restart** &ndash; rewind to the first stop on this tour <br>
      {[bm,5]} **End** &ndash; stop this tour and close the **EM&bull;TOUR GUIDE**<br>

      Click on **Next** to continue with **Tour&thinsp;01**.

  - cmds:
      - view 1
    text: |

        {[ht,household_supplies]Tidying up &ndash; Activity bar}

  - cmds:
      - view 2
    text: |

        {[ht,household_supplies]Tidying up &ndash; Outline view}




